<title>UK: Brent cargo trades weaker at March +29 - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades weaker at March +29 - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo due to load February 16-18 traded between European majors on Monday at March Brent +29 cents a barrel, traders said.</p>
<p>A Brent for loading February 12-14 traded on Friday at March Brent +33 cents.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
